Package: samjr
Type: Package
Title: Minimal RTMB Re-Implementation of SAM
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anders", "Nielsen", email = "fishfollower@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(c("Christoffer", "Moesgaard"), "Albertsen", email = "cmoe@aqua.dtu.dk", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides a small subset of the SAM stockassessment user interface
    (read.ices, setup.sam.data, defcon, defpar, sam.fit) backed by a pure-R
    RTMB implementation of the state-space age-structured assessment model.
    First version mirrors the workflow used in SAM/testmore/nscod/script.R.
    Also includes deterministic per-recruit and equilibrium reference points
    (referencepoints, perRecruitClosure) with delta-method confidence
    intervals, plus stochastic harvest control rule projections (hcr,
    icesAdviceRule), mirroring SAM's stockassessment reference points.
License: GPL-2
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), RTMB
Imports: Matrix, methods, stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, parallel,
    offarray, offartmb
Suggests: ellipse
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
